+++ b/orchestration/state/phase_9_attempt_1_timeseries_agent_evidence_20260816.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@
+Phase 9 Time-Series Agent implementation evidence
+Attempt: 1 of 3
+Final artifact: artifacts/phase9/phase9_attempt_1_final_20260816T012000Z
+
+Implementation
+- Added experiments/phase9_time_series_baselines.py.
